  "name": "Testaktivitet",
  "date": "2026-11-22",
  "time": "12:00",
  "priceAmount": "hej",
  "category": "Test",
  "notes": ""
}


### 13. Null som request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}
Content-Type: application/json

null


### 14. Gyldig destination - forvent 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "OSL"
}


### 15. Decimal i antal voksne - forvent 400
