  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-25",
  "adults": 1.5,
  "directOnly": false
}


### 16. Gyldige rejseoplysninger - forvent 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft/details
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "CPH",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-25",
  "adults": 1,
  "directOnly": false
}


### 17. Søg efter flybilletter med Duffel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/flights/search
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}


